{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1909","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F2. Small Permutation Problem (Hard Version)"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"https://soundcloud.com/tunners/miniboss"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Andy Tunstall - MiniBoss"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"⠀"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the easy version, the $$$a_i$$$ are in the range $$$[0, n]$$$; in the hard version, the $$$a_i$$$ are in the range $$$[-1, n]$$$ and the definition of good permutation is slightly different. You can make hacks only if all versions of the problem are solved."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an integer $$$n$$$ and an array $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ of integers in the range $$$[-1, n]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A permutation $$$p_1, p_2, \\dots, p_n$$$ of $$$[1, 2, \\dots, n]$$$ is good if, for each $$$i$$$, the following condition is true: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if $$$a_i \\neq -1$$$, the number of values $$$\\leq i$$$ in $$$[p_1, p_2, \\dots, p_i]$$$ is exactly $$$a_i$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Count the good permutations of $$$[1, 2, \\dots, n]$$$, modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$). The description of the test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of the array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$-1 \\le a_i \\le n$$$), which describe the conditions for a good permutation."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single line containing the number of good permutations, modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10\n5\n-1 -1 -1 -1 -1\n5\n1 2 3 4 5\n6\n0 2 2 2 -1 -1\n6\n-1 -1 -1 -1 -1 5\n6\n-1 -1 3 2 -1 -1\n15\n0 0 -1 -1 -1 2 2 -1 -1 -1 -1 9 11 13 15\n6\n0 2 2 2 4 6\n6\n0 1 3 4 5 5\n6\n1 2 3 2 4 6\n15\n0 0 1 1 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 9 11 13 15\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n120\n1\n4\n0\n0\n494403526\n4\n0\n0\n532305727\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, all the permutations of length $$$5$$$ are good, so there are $$$120$$$ good permutations."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, the only good permutation is $$$[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third test case, there are $$$4$$$ good permutations: $$$[2, 1, 5, 6, 3, 4]$$$, $$$[2, 1, 5, 6, 4, 3]$$$, $$$[2, 1, 6, 5, 3, 4]$$$, $$$[2, 1, 6, 5, 4, 3]$$$. For example, $$$[2, 1, 5, 6, 3, 4]$$$ is good because: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_1 = 0$$$, and there are $$$0$$$ values $$$\\leq 1$$$ in $$$[p_1] = [2]$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_2 = 2$$$, and there are $$$2$$$ values $$$\\leq 2$$$ in $$$[p_1, p_2] = [2, 1]$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_3 = 2$$$, and there are $$$2$$$ values $$$\\leq 3$$$ in $$$[p_1, p_2, p_3] = [2, 1, 5]$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_4 = 2$$$, and there are $$$2$$$ values $$$\\leq 4$$$ in $$$[p_1, p_2, p_3, p_4] = [2, 1, 5, 6]$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_5 = -1$$$, so there are no restrictions on $$$[p_1, p_2, p_3, p_4, p_5]$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_6 = -1$$$, so there are no restrictions on $$$[p_1, p_2, p_3, p_4, p_5, p_6]$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F2","problemCode":"1909F2","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1909/problem/F2"}